NETWATCH NG Debian package
==========================

This is a development build of NETWATCH NG 2.x.

Launch the terminal interface with:

    netwatch-ng

Some operations that modify firewall or traffic-control state require
root privileges. Prefer running without root for read-only inspection;
use a privileged session only when necessary.

Optional tools are detected at runtime. Missing optional tools disable
only the features that depend on them.

Traffic rate limits currently use tc packet policing: packets above the
configured rate are dropped. This is not smooth queue-based HTB shaping.
